                ```sql
                SELECT sp.SALES_PRICE_NO,
                       sp.PRODUCT_NO,
                       p.PURCHASE_RATE,
                       sp.UOM_NO,
                       sp.SALES_RATE,
                       sp.EFFECTIVE_DATE,
                       sp.ACTIVE_FLAG,
                       sp.CREATED_BY,
                       sp.CREATED_DATE,
                       sp.UPDATED_BY,
                       sp.UPDATED_DATE
                  FROM MST_SALES_PRICE sp
                  JOIN MST_PRODUCT p
                    ON p.PRODUCT_NO = sp.PRODUCT_NO;
                ```
